\section{Results}

\subsection{Headline estimates across methods}

Table~\ref{tab:headline} reports the $\BlueCCS$ hazard ratio under all eleven estimators. The estimates that yield interior solutions cluster between approximately 5 and 14, with the doubly robust marginal estimate at $\HR = 6.87$ as our preferred specification.

