GLM, cluster sponsor SE & 14.32 & SE $0.328$ & $<0.0001$ & 4{,}246 p-yr \\
GLM, cluster sponsor$\times$region SE & 14.32 & SE $0.490$ & $<0.0001$ & 4{,}246 p-yr \\
Cox PH & 11.93 & $[4.67, 30.49]$ & $<0.0001$ & 714 proj. \\
PSM, caliper $0.05$ & 5.22 & SE $1.09$ & $0.130$ & 992 p-yr \\
IPW (stabilised) & 14.50 & SE $0.51$ & $<0.0001$ & 3{,}706 p-yr \\
